    "body": "Hint: Distribute the cross product just like multiplication: $\\vec{v} \\times (A - B) = (\\vec{v} \\times A) - (\\vec{v} \\times B)$. Remember two key properties:Any vector crossed with itself is zero ($\\vec{v} \\times \\vec{v} = \\vec{0}$).$\\vec{v} \\times \\vec{w} = -(\\vec{w} \\times \\vec{v})$.",
